# Keep LF in the working tree on every OS. With core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) shell
# scripts get CRLF, and Harbor copies them into the Linux images, where they fail (#22, 15:58).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
ed72/environment/ward text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
